## Information
Transform your space effortlessly with HOMCOM's Artificial Plants! This 2-pack features realistic boxwood topiary balls with lush eucalyptus leaves, suitable as small fake plants indoors and out. UV-resistant and maintenance-free, pop them into the ground or a planter and enjoy the green without the fuss. Friendly for those without a green thumb!
